07:03.100 --> 07:09.240
And P is for proposed, outlining specific counterfactual experiments that haven't been done yet.

07:09.240 --> 07:09.620
Right.

07:09.700 --> 07:12.780
Because when you force an author to explicitly tag their assumptions,

07:12.780 --> 07:17.020
