10:27.840 --> 10:29.200
Right. Because math is just math.

10:29.460 --> 10:42.060
Exactly. When the separation between two overlapping peaks falls below the actual line width of those peaks, the mathematical matrix underlying the optimization algorithm, the Jacobian matrix, it becomes nearly collinear.

